   562	
   563	Rank 7 is an architectural fallback, not a reason to postpone the inexpensive row test in rank 1. Its first wrapper measurement should happen before investing in a full alternative VM.
   564	
   565	GPU work cannot change the number of rows required by the recursive relation. The existing backend seam accelerates MSM execution, while the machine’s CPU and GPU share memory. The current speed record also contains an overlapping `m + q` sum; the review correctly distinguishes it from the union of those phases. [`P:poly/kzg/msm.rs:163`; `research/sherlock-speed-replan-20261108/gpu.md:14`; `research/sherlock-recursion-design-review-20261110/review.md:50`]
   566	
   567	The decisive measurements are therefore the **hardened binary node**, the **complete decider**, and **useful processor work per proof**. If they fail, retain the complete GP specification and change the inner proof system.

