   421	| Unique genesis | Exactly one canonical genesis **per run identity**. A batch can contain many distinct runs and therefore many genesis states. |
   422	| Exactly-once execution | For each run, enabled owner transitions tile its claimed interval without gaps or repeated positions. |
   423	| DAG fan-out | Repeated references to a verified claim are allowed. Each reference has an explicit consumer and input position. |
