   487	## 6. Migration and milestones
   488	
   489	### Preserve
   490	
   491	- **Reference semantics and C6 rule reasoning.** Reuse them as the specification and differential oracle for the committed-memory interpreter. The existing full-carrier encoding is not the new memory architecture. [`D:design.md:27`; `crates/mori-backend/src/sherlock_c6_child.rs:551`]
   492	- **Height and genesis-carry hardening.** Preserve their obligations and negative cases, while adapting the accumulator representation and disabled-slot normalization. [`crates/mori-recursion/src/ivc.rs:497`; `crates/mori-recursion/src/ivc.rs:517`]
   493	- **Terminal pairing implementation.** Reuse its arithmetic and binding checks in the new decider. [`crates/mori-recursion/src/run_decider.rs:247`]
